<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed sharply lower in heavy trading Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 70.73 to 6402.52.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 4.36 to 389.54.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.45.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 2122 to 506.</p>
<p>Volume was 494,131,010, compared with 446,115,270 Tuesday.</p>
